    "detailed_description": "&quot;Yin-Yang Labyrinth&quot; is a Chinese-style multiplayer online Roguelike dungeon crawler game.<br />\r\nOne step to life, one step to death. Mysterious and deadly labyrinths. You and your companions find yourselves trapped in a bizarre maze. You must work together to overcome challenges and escape the labyrinth.<br />\r\nDiverse Maps: The game features a variety of level designs with different gameplay, and each level is randomly generated.<br />\r\nMultiple Professions: Players can choose from various professions to collaborate and navigate through levels.<br />\r\nDiverse Builds: In addition to professional skills, the game offers Yin-Yang glyphs, magical treasures, equipment, and general skills to construct various gameplay builds.",
